cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the paper (preferred-citation); if you use the finality package, also cite the software."
title: "finality: finality, extreme-value uncertainty and contagion in banking-sector cyber risk"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible research code for banking-sector cyber risk: a rational-choice
  model of attacker venue selection with an exact finality decomposition, a
  loss-distribution Monte Carlo with a planted Pareto tail, peaks-over-threshold
  GPD inference with delta-method, parametric-bootstrap and profile-likelihood
  intervals, a Monte Carlo audit of their coverage for extreme return levels,
  and a linear DebtRank model of interbank contagion.
type: software
